      ***************************************************************
      * A0000-PROCESS-PARMS:                                        *
      *     1. VERIFY CONTROL PARMS READ FROM PARMLIB MEMBER        *
      *     2. ACCEPT SYSTEM DATE AND TIME                          *
      *     3. MOVE THIS INFORMATION TO HEADINGS                    *
      ***************************************************************
       A0000-PROCESS-PARMS.

           MOVE "A0000-PROCESS-PARMS" TO WS-PARAGRAPH.

           ACCEPT WS-CURRENT-DT FROM DATE.

      * Begin Y2K Fix
      *    MOVE WS-CD-MONTH  TO WS-FD-MONTH.
      *    MOVE WS-CD-DAY    TO WS-FD-DAY.
      *    MOVE WS-CD-YEAR   TO WS-FD-YEAR.


           MOVE WS-CD-MONTH  TO WS-FD-MONTH
                                Y2K-CD-MONTH.

           MOVE WS-CD-DAY    TO WS-FD-DAY
                                Y2K-CD-DAY.

           IF WS-CD-YEAR >= 50
              MOVE 19 TO Y2K-CD-CC
           ELSE
              MOVE 20 TO Y2K-CD-CC.

           MOVE WS-CD-YEAR   TO WS-FD-YEAR
                                Y2K-CD-YY.

           MOVE Y2K-CD-YEAR TO WS-VALID-EFF-YEAR.

      * End Y2K Fix

           MOVE WS-FORMAT-DT TO HDG-DT.

           READ CONTROL-PARMS INTO WS-CNTL-PARM-REC
             AT END
                DISPLAY WS-ERR-MSG-CP1
                MOVE V-MISSING-CNTL-PARM TO WS-ABEND-CODE
                PERFORM Y2000-ABEND THRU Y2000-EXIT.

           IF CNTL-OEM-NUM NOT NUMERIC
             DISPLAY WS-ERR-MSG-CP2
             MOVE V-INVALID-CNTL-PARM TO WS-ABEND-CODE
             PERFORM Y2000-ABEND THRU Y2000-EXIT.

           MOVE CNTL-REGN-CD   TO WS-SEL-REGN-CD.
           MOVE CNTL-EFF-MONTH TO WS-TEMP-EFF-MONTH.
           MOVE CNTL-EFF-DAY   TO WS-TEMP-EFF-DAY.
           MOVE CNTL-EFF-YEAR  TO WS-TEMP-EFF-YEAR.
           MOVE CNTL-EFF-YEAR  TO WS-VAR-YEAR.

           IF WS-TEMP-EFF-DT NOT NUMERIC OR WS-TEMP-EFF-DT <= ZEROES
             DISPLAY WS-ERR-MSG-CP3
             MOVE V-INVALID-DATE TO WS-ABEND-CODE
             PERFORM Y2000-ABEND THRU Y2000-EXIT.

      * TO DETERMINE IF CONTROL PARM EFFECTIVE DATE IS > 6 MONTHS
      * FROM CURRENT DATE.  IF SO, ABEND.
      * Begin Y2K Fix
      *    MOVE WS-CURRENT-DT TO WS-VALID-EFF-DT.
           MOVE Y2K-CURRENT-DT TO WS-VALID-EFF-DT.
      * End Y2K Fix

           ADD 6 TO WS-VALID-EFF-MONTH.
           IF WS-VALID-EFF-MONTH > 12
              SUBTRACT 12 FROM WS-VALID-EFF-MONTH
              ADD 1 TO WS-VALID-EFF-YEAR.

           MOVE WS-TEMP-EFF-YEAR TO WS-CNTL-PARM-YR.

      * Begin Y2K Fix
      *    IF WS-CNTL-PARM-YR-3-4 = WS-VALID-EFF-YEAR
           IF WS-CNTL-PARM-YR = WS-VALID-EFF-YEAR
              IF WS-TEMP-EFF-MONTH <= WS-VALID-EFF-MONTH
                 CONTINUE
              ELSE
                 DISPLAY "DATE ON CONTROL PARM IS NOT WITHIN 6"
                 DISPLAY " MONTHS OF CURRENT DATE.  CHECK, CORRECT,"
                 DISPLAY " AND RERUN"
                 MOVE V-INVALID-DATE TO WS-ABEND-CODE
                 PERFORM Y2000-ABEND THRU Y2000-EXIT
           ELSE
      *       IF WS-CNTL-PARM-YR-3-4 < WS-VALID-EFF-YEAR
              IF WS-CNTL-PARM-YR < WS-VALID-EFF-YEAR
                 CONTINUE
              ELSE
                 DISPLAY "DATE ON CONTROL PARM IS NOT WITHIN 6"
                 DISPLAY " MONTHS OF CURRENT DATE.  CHECK, CORRECT,"
                 DISPLAY " AND RERUN"
                 MOVE V-INVALID-DATE TO WS-ABEND-CODE
                 PERFORM Y2000-ABEND THRU Y2000-EXIT.
      * End Y2K Fix

