      *     4. SUBTRACT THE RECORD COUNT OF LAST RUN FROM THE RECORD*
      *        COUNT OF THIS RUN FOR EACH RECORD TYPE TO FIND THE   *
      *        DIFFERENCES.                                         *
      *     5. CONVERT THE DIFFERENCES TO PERCENTAGE                *
      *     6. COMPARE THE TWO PERCENTAGE VAL'S FOR EACH RECORD TYPE*
      *        IF THE PERCENTAGE DIFFERENCES FROM THIS RUN IS       *
      *        GREATER THAN THE ALLOWABLE VALUE, VALUE THE          *
      *        WS-BAL-COMMENT WITH "IN ERROR"                       *
      *        OTHERWISE, VALUE THE BAL-COMMENT WITH "OKAY".        *
