      *  CHECK THE ASSEMBLY TO COMPONENT RECORD

           MOVE WS-A-WRITTEN-CTR      TO  WS-THIS-COUNT.
           MOVE WS-ASSY-WRITTEN-COUNT TO  WS-LAST-COUNT.
           DISPLAY "   ".
           DISPLAY "LAST RUN ASSY-WRITTEN CNT=" WS-LAST-COUNT
