      *  CHECK THE SUPERCESSION  RECORD

           MOVE WS-N-WRITTEN-CTR       TO  WS-THIS-COUNT.
           MOVE WS-SUPER-WRITTEN-COUNT TO  WS-LAST-COUNT.
           DISPLAY "  ".
