           PERFORM Z1200-PERCENT-CALCULATION THRU Z1200-EXIT.
           IF (WS-RESULT-WHOLE-NUM IS
              GREATER THAN WS-ALLOWABLE-WHOLE-NUM
              AND WS-HIST-SUPER-FLAG = 'Y')
              DISPLAY WS-OUT-OF-BAL-MSG3
              MOVE "Y" TO WS-OUT-OF-BAL-SW.

      *  IF DON'T SEND HIST SUPERS, AND RECORD COUNT = 0 AND 
      *  PREVIOUS WAS > 0 TH
      

           IF (WS-HIST-SUPER-FLAG = 'N' 
                AND WS-THIS-COUNT = 0
                AND WS-LAST-COUNT > 0)
                 DISPLAY "* ERROR - SUPER COUNT IS ZERO *"
                 MOVE "Y" TO WS-OUT-OF-BAL-SW.

