              DISPLAY WS-OUT-OF-BAL-MSG4
              MOVE "Y" TO WS-OUT-OF-BAL-SW.

      *  CHECK THE PRICE RECORD

           MOVE WS-P-WRITTEN-CTR       TO  WS-THIS-COUNT.
           MOVE WS-PRICE-WRITTEN-COUNT TO  WS-LAST-COUNT.
           DISPLAY "    ".
