       Z1200-PERCENT-CALCULATION.
      ***************************************************************
      * Z1200-PERCENT-CALCULLATION                                  *
      *     1.  CONVERT RECORD COUNT DIFFEENCES TO PERCENTAGE       *
      *     2.  BYPASS CALCULATION IF BOTH THIS RUN & LAST RUN = 0  *
      *     3.  IF LAST RUN = 0 & THIS RUN IS VALUED,               *
      *         THEN PERCENT CHANGE = 100; BYPASS CALCULATION       *
      ***************************************************************
             MOVE "Z1200-PERCENT-CALCULATION" TO WS-PARAGRAPH.
             MOVE ZEROES TO WS-RESULT,
                            WS-RESULT-WHOLE-NUM.

             IF WS-LAST-COUNT EQUAL ZEROES AND
                WS-THIS-COUNT EQUAL ZEROES
               GO TO Z1200-EXIT
             ELSE
               IF WS-LAST-COUNT EQUAL ZEROES AND
                  WS-THIS-COUNT NOT EQUAL ZEROES
                  MOVE 100 TO WS-RESULT-WHOLE-NUM
                  DISPLAY "CALCULATED PERCENT CHANGE IN THIS RUN="
                     WS-RESULT-WHOLE-NUM
                 GO TO Z1200-EXIT.

             SUBTRACT WS-LAST-COUNT FROM WS-THIS-COUNT
                 GIVING WS-RESULT.

             COMPUTE WS-RESULT-WHOLE-NUM ROUNDED =
                 (WS-RESULT / WS-LAST-COUNT ) * 100.
             DISPLAY "CALCULATED PERCENT CHANGE IN THIS RUN="
                     WS-RESULT-WHOLE-NUM.

